14. AI AND MACHINE LEARNING
============================================================

14.1 This License does not grant permission to use Rawline Source Code,
documentation, commit history, or other Rawline materials as training,
fine-tuning, reinforcement-learning, distillation, or dataset material
for an artificial-intelligence or machine-learning model.

14.2 Such use requires separate written permission from the Licensor.

14.3 Section 14.1 does not prohibit ordinary transient use of an AI
assistant or code-analysis tool to:

(a) inspect Rawline code;
(b) explain Rawline code;
(c) assist a permitted user in modifying Rawline;
(d) debug Rawline;
(e) generate patches; or
(f) otherwise assist with development,

provided the Rawline materials are not intentionally incorporated into
a model-training or fine-tuning dataset by the user exercising rights
under this License.


