20.2 Except where immediate relief is reasonably necessary, You shall
have seven (7) calendar days after receiving written notice of the
violation to completely cure the violation.

20.3 If the violation is fully cured within that period, Your rights are
reinstated unless:

(a) the violation was intentionally fraudulent;
(b) the violation involved deliberate commercial exploitation after
    prior notice;
(c) You previously committed substantially the same violation; or
(d) reinstatement would otherwise be expressly denied by the Licensor
    as permitted by applicable law.

20.4 After final termination You must cease unauthorized use,
Distribution, and commercial exploitation of Rawline.

20.5 Termination does not eliminate claims arising from conduct that
occurred before termination.


